      },
      {
        "y": 396.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 530.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "thesis a very long, original, research-based work, perhaps 80–100,000 words, for a higher degree (e.g. PhD)"
      },
      {
        "y": 417.7,
        "x0": 106.2,
        "x1": 499,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "It’s a good idea to start with a mind map1 when preparing an essay. Always write a first draft2"
      },
      {
        "y": 429.7,
        "x0": 106.2,
        "x1": 511.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "before writing up the final version. Your essay should be all your own work; plagiarism3 is a very"
      },
      {
        "y": 442.8,
        "x0": 106.2,
        "x1": 512.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "serious offence in colleges and universities. It is an increasing problem because it is so easy to cut"
      },
      {
        "y": 454.6,
        "x0": 106.2,
        "x1": 508.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and paste from materials available on the internet, and students have to sign a plagiarism form"
      },
      {
        "y": 465.7,
        "x0": 106.2,
        "x1": 511.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "to say that the work they are handing in is all their own and that they acknowledge4 any sources"
      },
      {
        "y": 477.7,
        "x0": 106.2,
        "x1": 501.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "they have used. There is usually a deadline5. After the essay is submitted6, it will be assessed7"
      },
