        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 459.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Correct the wrong usage of words to do with written work in these sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 487,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 His PhD assignment was 90,000 words long and was on the history of US place names."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 454.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Little Martha did her first dissertation in school today. It was called ‘My family’."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 496.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 We have to hand in an essay at the end of the course. It can consist of up to five different"
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 190.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "pieces of work."
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 517.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The teacher gave us the title of this week’s project today. We have to write 1,000 words on the"
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 362,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "topic of ‘If I ruled the world’ and hand it in next Monday."
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 512,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 At the end of this course, you have to do a 5,000-word thesis which will be assessed, and the"
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 300.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "grade will contribute to your final degree."
      },
      {
        "y": 184,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 517.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 I think I’ll do a study of people’s personal banking habits for my MSc composition. It has to be"
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 212.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "about 12,000 words."
      },
      {
        "y": 208,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 525.5,
        "tag": "main",
